title: "Answer repair and downstream dependencies in activation transfer: code and results"
abstract: "Tests whether activation transfer that repairs a language model's answer in indirect-object identification also makes its later computation resemble the donor's, measured by a signature of downstream attention-head dependencies, mainly in GPT-2 Medium."
